#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_account_consolidation
msgid ""
"Group the companies of the database, map their charts of accounts to one "
"group chart, translate their balances into the group currency (closing, "
"average and historical rates), eliminate inter-company balances, sales and "
"purchases and dividends, add manual adjustments, and read the consolidated "
"trial balance, profit and loss and balance sheet with a column per company, "
"the eliminations and the group total, down to the journal items."
